	)
	(text "1. Option bytes: nSWBOOT0 = 0 (PB8 = BOOT0 is shared with FDCAN1_RX).\n2. TIM1 complementary PWM, CH1-CH4 + CH1N-CH4N, centre aligned 30 kHz (20-50 kHz).\n   DTG 50-100 ns is a backup only: DRV8300D inserts a fixed 200 ns dead time.\n3. Duty limit 97-98 % (bootstrap refresh). Pre-charge bootstraps (low sides on)\n   after every enable and after Hi-Z.\n4. Hardware trips: RS3 -> PB0 OPAMP3 (PGA) -> PB1 -> COMP1 -> TIM1_BKIN.\n   IA PC1 -> COMP3, IB PA7 -> COMP2 (DAC thresholds). ENABLE PC3 -> TIM1_BKIN2.\n5. ADC: IA PC1 = ADC1_IN7 and IB PA7 = ADC2_IN4 (simultaneous), VBUS PA0, NTC PC0.\n6. No brake chopper fitted: limit regen via VBUS monitoring (Q9/J9 footprint is DNP).\n7. External encoder uses SPI3 (SPI2 SCK only on PB13/PF1, both in use).\n8. ABI / Hall on TIM3 CH1-CH3 (encoder mode or Hall XOR interface)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 130.81 187.96 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b46e505b-78ad-5085-aea0-9067dc9afce3")
	)
